A||||12||merlin||Popular Mechanics compares the Fiero to VW Bug||||3||
Z||000000||merlin||08-22-2001||09:49 PM||||As I was rummaging around my father's basement I found a 1984 Popular Mechanics article, which happened to have an article on the future of the Fiero.  It was pretty interesting in that it theorized that the Fiero would become a "cult car" much like the VW Bug.  I scanned in the article and it's available at the below address.<BR> <A HREF="http://people.ne.mediaone.net/witherscd/PM1.html" TARGET=_blank>http://people.ne.mediaone.net/witherscd/PM1.html</A> <P>So, what do you think?..  Is it really a "cult car"?...||||reg||3
Z||000001||Tabs||08-22-2001||10:01 PM||||Very cool story. I wish they didn't stop making the Fiero it had such a bright future!<P>Tabs||||reg||11
