Z||000005||Ken Wittlief||08-23-2001||03:01 PM||||hey that was pretty good prediciting for '84 - they are correct - alot of car kits are out there that are based on the fiero chassis and drivetrain<P>  they were kinda stuck in VW mentality though, jeeps and dunebuggys?! the VW was good for offroading  cause it was light and had good ground clearance - the fiero was low to the ground and designed for speed.<P>  I think the biggest detraction from the fiero becoming a bigger kit car thing is that it doesnt need it as much as the VW bug did - the fiero looks great just as it is - the bug was functional but ugly.||||reg||10
