Z||000007||Cliff Pennock||08-23-2001||04:40 PM||||Interesting. Almost all current VW bugs were recalled in their first year because of a problem with the engine: an EGR pipe was running to close to the decklid and the enginebay actually caught on fire on a few bugs... True story.||||reg||1
